In addition to the other good advice, I'd add:
1) I'd recommend that you avoid increasing your XP beyond 14.  When at
14 you will have available the beginning Quest levels where you might
find some useful equipment.  But, in general increasing your XP at this
stage will make your life more difficult.  You have charm monster;
charm some useful creatures and let them gain the experience.
2) Do you have reflection yet?  It only takes one lucky @ with a wand
of death to end your game.
3) Start collecting gold and gain some intrinsic AC.  It weighs
nothing!
